<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Exxon said raised by DLJ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Exxon said raised by DLJ.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette upgraded Exxon Corp to outperform from market perform, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 86-1/8.</p>
